pps/1972740/extras/a33fec5295cc34c5b0d67b2c0f7a5e85.webm?t=1688078823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972740/extras/a33fec5295cc34c5b0d67b2c0f7a5e85.mp4?t=1688078823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 50 hand-crafted levels;<br></li><li> Original soundtrack, composed especially for you to feel immersed in the game;<br></li><li> Made for everyone who loves puzzles;<br></li><li> In each level a new challenge;</li></ul>",
